### Create merchandise (admin)
# @name createMerchandise
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchandise
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Finisher T-Shirt",
  "description": "Dri-fit finisher tee"
}

@merchandiseId = {{createMerchandise.response.body.data.id}}

### List merchandise (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchandise

### Get merchandise
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchandise/{{merchandiseId}}

### Update merchandise (admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/merchandise/{{merchandiseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Premium dri-fit finisher tee"
}

### Delete merchandise (admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/merchandise/{{merchandiseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
